\[Rho]\), \(d\)]], SubscriptBox[\(g\), \(\*SubscriptBox[\(\[Pi]\), \(d\)] \
\*SubscriptBox[\(\[Rho]\), \(d\)]\)]]\)\[Kappa] = \
2\!\(\*FractionBox[SubscriptBox[SuperscriptBox[\(m\), \(2\)], SubscriptBox[\(\
